        "korean": "忙しなくする日々 Keeping myself busy\n紛らわすため埋め込んだ Schedule\nでも忘れられないよ\n脳裏に焼き付いてる Like tattoo",
        "romanization": "sewashinaku suru hibi Keeping myself busy\nmagirawasu tame umekon da Schedule\nde mo wasure rare nai yo\nnouri ni yakitsui teru Like tattoo",
        "english": "Keeping myself busy with the days that have become hectic\nIn order to become distracted, the schedule is all filled up\nBut I’m unable to forget\nIt’s burned into my mind like a tattoo",
        "startChunk": 1120,
        "isAdLib": false,
